            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <section id="contact">
        <div class="container">
            <h2>Join the "Pure Best" Beta</h2>
            <p>Register to become a "pure best" `NeuroPet` beta tester and build your "pure best" "strongest self."</p>
            
            <form>
                <input type="text" placeholder="Your Name" required>
